flowchart TD
    A["Start monitor"] --> B["Resolve environment, .env and SQLite settings<br/>Create runtime snapshot and notifiers"]
    B --> C["Start round: heartbeat and scrape plan"]
    C --> D["Unified per-source scheduling<br/>circuit breaking, pacing, proxy and failure isolation"]
    D --> E["Holland2Stay / Xior<br/>separate browser worker processes"]
    D --> F["OurDomain / OurCampus / Magis<br/>Student Experience / Plaza"]
    E --> G["Merge listings and completeness"]
    F --> G
    G --> H["Diff and persist new listings and status changes"]
    H --> I["Replay pending events, then filter shadow sources"]
    I --> J["Match users and collect booking candidates"]
    J --> K["Holland2Stay pre-login and booking<br/>Plaza applications require user opt-in"]
    K --> L["Submit booking tasks in parallel with listing notifications"]
    L --> M["Deliver listing, status and booking results<br/>Web, external channels and mobile push"]
    M --> N["Mark events processed and save retry state"]
    N --> O["Converge stale listings using complete scans"]
    O --> P["Round cleanup and maintenance; wait for next round"]
    P --> C
    K --> Q{"Is the result certain?"}
    Q -->|No| R["Persist a guard and ask the user to verify<br/>H2S by account; Plaza by account and listing"]
    Q -->|H2S success| S["Return payment URL; user pays"]
    Q -->|Plaza success| T["Application submitted; housing is not guaranteed"]
    W["Web / API"] <--> DB[("SQLite")]
    H <--> DB
    W --> X["Map, dashboard and forms read per-request saved settings<br/>Settings page separately shows monitor acknowledgement"]
